# Elective 02 — Guardrails & Safety Layer
# The core runs OFFLINE with no provider. You only need a provider for the extensions
# (live agent / LLM-as-classifier guard). Copy to .env and fill in if you use them.

# --- Option A: local, free, no key (recommended for extensions) ---
# USE_OLLAMA=1
# OLLAMA_MODEL=ollama/qwen3.5:4b

# --- Option B: cloud (first key present wins; Groq has a free tier) ---
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Route the provided agent through a real model (live-agent extension) ---
# LIVE_AGENT=1

# Explicit override (wins over everything above)
# LLM_MODEL=
